flowchart TD
    A[User uploads source file] --> B[File Service: validate extension, size, UTF-8, parseability]
    B -->|valid| C[Store file + SHA-256 hash + Submission record]
    B -->|invalid| Z1[Return 400 error]
    C --> D[User selects two submissions]
    D --> E[Comparison Service reads both source files]
    E --> F[AST Engine: parse both]
    F --> G[Normalize identifiers in both ASTs]
    G --> H[Extract structural features for both]
    H --> I[Compute AST / Token / Cosine / Tree-Edit similarity]
    I --> J[ML Engine: predict similarity score from feature vector]
    J --> K[Weighted final score = 0.4*AST + 0.2*Token + 0.2*Structural + 0.2*ML]
    K --> L[Classify risk level from configurable thresholds]
    L --> M[Persist Comparison record]
    M --> N[Return breakdown + explanation to frontend]
    N --> O{User requests report?}
    O -->|yes| P[Report Service generates PDF]
    P --> Q[Persist Report record, return download link]
    O -->|no| R[End]
